cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the codifiability index in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Legal-to-Code: rules of international economic law as tested, traceable code"
abstract: >-
  Research framework for rules as code in international economic law. Provisions of the OECD Model
  Tax Convention, the WTO Dispute Settlement Understanding, the GATS and the GloBE rules are classified
  by codifiability (computable, structurable, not codifiable), implemented as traced rules, and annotated
  with the ambiguities found while encoding them.
type: software
authors:
